.nh
.TH "PB-RECORDINGS-KEY" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recordings-key - Manage a team's recording key


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recordings key [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the team recording key that terminal recordings are sealed to. A team member who holds a copy of the current key can replace it with \fBpb recordings key replace\fR: the new key is made and signed on this computer, and machines accept it only through that signature.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for key


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-recordings(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-key-replace(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-key-reset(1)\fP
